'''Snowman''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Snowman has a snowy white blade with a mini snowman face on it made out of coal and a carrot. Its guard is bright red, and its handle is white, having 3 mini coal dots.

==Trivia ==
*It has a [[Snowman Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 18, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2659487398/Snowman-Knife here].

